# Pain for All on Bot1's Grizzly Bears (2/2). Its enters ability has the Bears deal damage equal to their power (2) to Bot2
# (20 -> 18); the Bears can't be the "other" target. Then Bot2 bolts the Bears: the damage is lethal, and the Bears are still dealt
# it, so the Aura triggers and the Bears (already dead by the time it resolves) deal that much (3) to the opponent: 18 -> 15.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Grizzly Bears
Pain for All
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Pain for All.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears)
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Life = 18
? Bot1.Battlefield.Pain for All.AttachedTo = Grizzly Bears
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard = Pain for All; Grizzly Bears
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 15
Bot1.Graveyard = Pain for All; Grizzly Bears
